How about using the wands of polymorph to polypile for a shield of
reflection?
Another option is polymorphing into a (female) cockatrice and laying
some eggs.  (If you haven't done this before, there are some
subtleties about egg-laying and being a bird, namely you can't open a
bag but need to eat after laying eggs and it is possible for the eggs
to hatch before you change back because you have no hands with which
to put the eggs in a container.)    You'll lose a bunch of luck when
they splat but with max luck you can throw 6 and still have positive
luck.  That could be (up to) 6 nasty angels, priests or role-monsters
on Astral.  You could even let some of the eggs hatch on Level 1 and
have a 33% chance for each to leave you a corpse, if you hustle, that
rubber chicken may last to Astral.  Rodney is hard to hit with a
rubber chicken so caution.

